WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.427
Chowla's conjecture, the two-point case.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.524
Each number gets plus or minus one by its prime factors' parity.

3
00:00:06.674 --> 00:00:10.271
Do neighbours correlate? Tao proved it only with logarithmic weights.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.132
Claimed: no correlation, with plain averages. Two points only.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.232
Lean: main theorem.
